COMMENT ON VIEW "research_election_2022_polling" IS E'{"grain":"polling station and election","keys":["locality_code","polling_station"],"source":"https://data.gov.il/he/datasets/central-election-committee/votes-knesset/cc223336-07bc-485d-b160-62df92967c0a","caveats":["Historical observations are restricted to 2022 onward. Current geography/planning references are retained regardless of original creation year.","Raw tables retain change versions; use the semantic view for analysis.","Empty and nonnumeric values become NULL, not zero.","Polling stations are not statistical-area boundaries; spatial linkage requires verified station locations.","Use election results as contextual data; no automatic property-price coefficient.","Calculate party vote shares using valid_votes; calculate turnout using eligible_voters. Never average polling-station percentages without weighting."]}';
